  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SFM kommer med svenska medel driva tre projekt; I. Paralegals projekt f&#xF6;r att &#xF6;ka tillg&#xE5;ngen till juridisk r&#xE5;dgivning, II. St&#xE4;rka kvinnors  politiska och sociala inflytande i landets regioner, III. St&#xE4;rka      regionala mediers n&#xE4;tverk f&#xF6;r &#xF6;kad information till befolkningen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish funds to SFM are directed to three projects; I. Legal         empowerment of rural communities through a network of community-based paralegals; II. Empowerment of women from rural areas; III.           Strengthen regional media network for informed citizenry,             participatory governance and accountability.</narrative>
  </description>
